@startuml
title FEQ-D04 Readback Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS Fiscal Workflow\nor Projection Worker" as Central
participant "Fiscal Exception Queue" as FEQ
participant "FEQ Worker / Approved Backend" as Worker
participant "POS Server GET / Read API" as POS
participant "Central PMS Fiscal Reference Store" as Store
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit
participant "Operator Console" as OC
participant "Management Dashboard" as MDR

Central -> FEQ : Detect fiscal exception\nor unknown outcome
FEQ -> Worker : Pick eligible exception
Worker -> Store : Load original request,\nreference, idempotency context
Worker -> POS : GET/readback using stable identifiers
POS --> Worker : matched / not found /\nmismatch / failed / unavailable / unknown
Worker -> FEQ : Classify readback result
Worker -> Store : Update fiscal reference state\nthrough approved workflow
Worker -> Audit : Record readback attempt,\nresult, evidence reference
FEQ -> OC : Update queue visibility
FEQ -> MDR : Publish projection update

note over OC,MDR
Operator Console and Management Dashboard do not call POS Server directly.
end note
@enduml
